  "dst": "entire grid as concentric Manhattan-distance rings centered on the marker",
  "transform": "use the marker color at distance 0, then advance one step per Manhattan distance through the fixed cycle green, yellow, black, grey, red, teal, maroon, pink, blue"
}
</annotation>
